Notebook[{Cell["CoefficientResult", "ObjectName"], 
  Cell["CoefficientResult[data] is an immutable report of a normalization \
solve: Rules, the numeric fit, exact candidates, the anchor, evidence and \
ProofStatus.", "Usage"], Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["CoefficientResult[data] is the immutable report of a normalization \
solve: Rules, NumericFit, ExactCandidates, the anchor (Normalization), \
Evidence (rank, residuals, orders, samples, holdouts) and ProofStatus \
(\"NumericalFit\", \"NumericallyCheckedReconstruction\", \
\"NumericallyCheckedExplicitRules\" or \"NumericalExplicitRules\" for \
explicit NormalizationRules, \"NotApplicable\"; \"Proven\" only from an exact \
identity).", "Notes"], Cell["No implemented route produces Proven at present \
(there is no exact identity certificate, and the S check is sampled), so \
RequireProof -> True currently refuses every form and model result with \
ProofRequired.", "Notes"], Cell["See Also", "SeeAlsoSection"], 
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["SolveModularCoefficients", 
      BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", ButtonData -> {"SolveModularCoefficients.nb", 
        None}], "  |  ", ButtonBox["ModularFormGetCoeff", 
      BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", ButtonData -> {"ModularFormGetCoeff.nb", 
        None}]}], "SeeAlso"], Cell["Examples Initialization", 
   "ExamplesInitializationSection"], Cell["Open this notebook in its \
repository location. GAP must be installed; LINS is required for its bounded \
search page. Evaluate the setup before the examples.", "ExampleText"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"Get", "[", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Nest", "[", RowBox[{"DirectoryName", 
                  ",", RowBox[{"NotebookFileName", "[", "]"}], ",", "5"}], 
                "]"}], ",", "\"Kernel\"", ",", "\"init.m\""}], "}"}], "]"}], 
        "]"}], ";"}]], "ExampleInitialization"], 
  Cell["Basic Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"g", "=", RowBox[{"BuildGroup", 
                "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"GroupPresentation", "[", RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"s\"", ",", "\"t\""}], "}"}], 
                      ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"s^2\"", ",", "\"t^2\"", 
                          ",", "\"(s.t)^3\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{"StoreGAPState", "\[Rule]", "False"}]}], "]"}]}], 
            ",", "d", ",", "one"}], "}"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{RowBox[{"AssignModularGenerators", "[", 
            RowBox[{"g", ",", RowBox[{"GroupWord", "[", "\"t^-1.s.t\"", 
                "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"GroupWord", "[", "\"s\"", "]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"StoreGAPState", "\[Rule]", "False"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"d", "=", RowBox[{"First", "[", RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
                RowBox[{RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"IrrepOrder\"", "]"}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"RepDim", "[", RowBox[
                         {"GroupRepresentation", "[", RowBox[{"g", ",", 
                          "#1"}], "]"}], "]"}], "===", "2"}], "&"}]}], "]"}], 
              "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"one", "=", RowBox[
             {RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"CharacterData\"", "]"}], "[", 
              "\"TrivialIrrepID\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"Head", "[", RowBox[{"SolveModularCoefficients", "[", 
              RowBox[{"g", ",", "one", ",", "4", ",", RowBox[
                 {"ModularFormDefinition", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", 
                      RowBox[{"ScalarModularExpression", "[", RowBox[
                         {"\"E4\"", ",", "q"}], "]"}], "}"}], ",", "q"}], 
                  "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]], "Input", 
   CellTags -> "VerifiedExample"], Cell[BoxData["CoefficientResult"], 
   "Output"], Cell["Possible Issues", "ExampleSection"], 
  Cell["Invalid input returns a structured Failure. Check FailureQ before \
using the result.", "ExampleText"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"FailureQ", "[", RowBox[{"SolveModularCoefficients", 
        "[", RowBox[{"1", ",", "2", ",", "3", ",", "4"}], "]"}], "]"}]], 
   "Input", CellTags -> "VerifiedErrorExample"], 
  Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output"], Cell["Related Guides", 
   "MoreAboutSection"], 
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["Constructing finite groups", 
      BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", ButtonData -> 
       {"../../Tutorials/ConstructingFiniteGroups.nb", None}]}], 
   "MoreAbout"], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["Metadata", "MetadataSection"], 
     Cell["Symbol", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Entity Type"], 
     Cell["VVMFTool", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Paclet Name"], 
     Cell["VVMFTool`", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Context"], 
     Cell["VVMFTool/ref/CoefficientResult", "Categorization", 
      CellLabel -> "URI"]}, Closed]]}, 
 WindowTitle -> "CoefficientResult \[LongDash] VVMFTool", 
 WindowSize -> {1000, 850}, TaggingRules -> <|"Paclet" -> "VVMFTool", 
   "Status" -> "Alpha"|>, StyleDefinitions -> FrontEnd`FileName[{"Wolfram"}, 
   "FunctionPageStylesExt.nb", CharacterEncoding -> "UTF-8"]]
